{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Mandate employers where 40%+ jobs cut due to AI to reduce working hours by 20%",
        "additional_details": "We think AI's benefits must be shared fairly. We call on the UK Government to regulate AI by requiring employers in sectors with 40%+ job losses to reduce working hours by 20% with no pay cut. Long weekends and free time for all\u2014not just the wealthy. In our view this protects jobs and ensures workers fairly share in AI's economic value.",
        "background": "We call on the Government to introduce regulation to safeguard AI's impact on jobs. We think such legislation should require employers in sectors where there has been 40%+ AI-driven job losses to reduce working hours by 20% with no pay cut, protecting workers and sharing AI's benefits fairly.",
